OL,3,ALetby doctor says inquiry 'grim
OL,4,Areading' and he wishes 'we had been
OL,5,Abrave enough to follow suspicions'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the senior doctors who tried to
OL,8,Fraise concerns about Lucy Letby with
OL,9,Fhospital managers has told the BBC the
OL,10,Ffinal inquiry report makes for "grim
OL,11,Freading".
OL,13,FConsultant paediatrician Dr John Gibbs
OL,14,Fworked at the Countess of Chester
OL,15,FHospital throughout the period in 2015
OL,16,Fto 2016 when Letby murdered seven
OL,17,Fbabies, and attempted to murder seven
OL,18,Fmore, on the neonatal unit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
