OL,3,AUK in talks about joining global
OL,4,Adefence bank led by Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government is in discussions
OL,7,Fabout joining a global investment bank,
OL,8,Faimed at raising more money for defence
OL,9,Fspending.
OL,11,FChancellor John Healey is considering a
OL,12,Fbid to join the Defence, Security and
OL,13,FResilience Bank (DSRB), not long after
OL,14,Fhis predecessor Rachel Reeves rejected
OL,15,Fthe idea.
OL,17,FCanada has been leading efforts to
OL,18,Festablish the bank, which supporters
OL,19,Fsay would enable governments to borrow
OL,20,Fat lower costs to increase military
OL,21,Fspending.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
